@startuml offering-concept
title Offering Concept ; per ADR-ES-021 + CR-ES-021

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Offering" as O {
  +customer_need
  +offering_objective
  +offering_context
  +authority_context
  +policy_context
  +constraint_context
  +governance_context
  +configuration_scope
  +composition_scope
  +fulfillment_scope
  +value_realization_scope
  +customer_outcome_scope
  +escalation_boundary
}

class "Customer Need" as CN
class "Product" as P
class "Service" as S
class "Capability" as Cap
class "Objective" as Obj
class "Context" as Ctx
class "Authority" as Auth
class "Policy" as Pol
class "Constraint" as Con
class "Governance" as Gov
class "Fulfillment Process" as FP
class "Customer Outcome" as CO
class "Value" as V
class "Escalation Boundary" as EB

O --> CN : addresses
O --> P : composes
O --> S : composes
O --> Cap : exercises
O --> Obj : pursues
O --> Ctx : responds-to
O --> Auth : operates-within
O --> Pol : governed-by
O --> Con : constrained-by
O --> Gov : operates-under
O --> FP : fulfilled-through
O --> CO : produces
O --> V : realizes
O --> EB : escalates-through

note right of O
  Foundational concept per ADR-ES-021 section 1.
  Resolves the Foundational Dependency Gate documented in
  ADR-ES-018 section 16 + ADR-ES-019 section 2.
end note

@enduml
